### Test USER role endpoint
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts/hello/user
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

### Test ADMIN role endpoint
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts/hello/admin
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

### Test SUPERADMIN role endpoint
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts/hello/superadmin
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

### Test endpoint requiring ADMIN or SUPERADMIN role
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts/hello/admin-role
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

### Test endpoint allowing USER, ADMIN, or SUPERADMIN role
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts/hello/role
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

### Test regular endpoint without role restrictions
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts/hello
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

### Test with wrong credentials
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts/hello/admin
Authorization: Basic admin wrongpassword
Accept: application/json

### Test with wrong username
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts/hello/admin
Authorization: Basic wrongusername admin
Accept: application/json
